apicalls_sample:
POST /v1/resources
Request JSON:
{
  "id": "optional-client-id",
  "name": "recommendation-endpoint",
  "environment_id": "env-prod-1",
  "placement": {
    "regions": ["us-west-2", "eu-central-1"],
    "preferred_clusters": []
  },
  "route_policy": {
    "mode": "primary-failover",
    "targets": [{"region": "us-west-2", "priority": 1}, {"region": "eu-central-1", "priority": 2}]
  }
}

Response 201:
{
  "id": "res-998",
  "resource_version": "rv-20241112-0001"
}

PUT /v1/resources/res-998 (update placement)
Headers: If-Match: rv-20241112-0001
Body: {"placement": {"regions":["us-west-2"]}}

Response 202 with operation id to track async fanout
